{"id":"GUQ2RfxjnIQnWGxY","meta":{"instanceId":"a5925672c1c1d5613a7bfd347269edc98458b5a7e08f0bf7445ee5349c8e0d91"},"name":"Answer finance queries from Xero via WhatsApp, Telegram and OpenAI","tags":[],"nodes":[{"id":"2215425a-b343-4ca9-b9a1-f89f07509f4c","name":"Overview","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[-224,-48],"parameters":{"color":7,"width":1280,"height":944,"content":"## Finance Bot - WhatsApp & Telegram, powered by Xero + OpenAI\n\n### How it works\nReceives WhatsApp (via WAHA) and Telegram messages, verifies WAHA requests, normalizes the message, authorizes the sender, loads conversation state, and routes either a Slack-share follow-up or a new finance request. New requests are classified with OpenAI, matching Xero data is fetched, OpenAI words the answer (validated against the Xero figures), the state is saved, and the reply goes back through the originating channel.\n\n**Read left to right: sections 1 to 10.**\n\n### Setup steps\n- Configure the WAHA webhook, base URL, session and HMAC SHA512 secret.\n- Connect Telegram bot credentials (trigger and send nodes).\n- Add OpenAI credentials (intent classifier and response writer).\n- Connect Xero OAuth2 credentials (connections, invoices, accounts, reports).\n- Connect Slack and set the target channel in the config node.\n- Create the n8n Data Table \"Finance Bot Conversation State\".\n- Update allowed users, channel IDs and tenant selection in \"Set Workflow Config\".\n\n### Customization\nAdjust the allowed users, OpenAI prompts, supported intents, Xero filters/date windows, Slack sharing behaviour and fallback wording."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"6b21ee5d-7a39-48bf-aa0d-7be9f94549c4","name":"Section 1. Intake & Normalization","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[-224,976],"parameters":{"color":4,"width":1344,"height":576,"content":"## 1. Intake & Normalization\n\nWhatsApp (WAHA) requests are HMAC-verified. WhatsApp and Telegram messages are normalized into one format and tagged with workflow config."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"13eb9174-b468-44f4-a08d-e19d755e1209","name":"Section 2. Authorize Finance User","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[1216,1088],"parameters":{"color":3,"width":480,"height":576,"content":"## 2. Authorize Finance User\n\nChecks the sender against the allowed-user list. Unauthorized users get an immediate rejection reply."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"cd9101ca-02e7-4557-a6e9-a14293e32dae","name":"Section 3. Load Conversation State","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[1792,1088],"parameters":{"color":6,"width":480,"height":576,"content":"## 3. Load Conversation State\n\nLoads the saved state for this chat and merges it with the new message. A failed lookup returns a recoverable error reply."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"5d8bb0ef-4bff-4961-8efe-df5ea5ab7be0","name":"Section 4. Route Conversation","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[2368,1088],"parameters":{"color":5,"width":480,"height":352,"content":"## 4. Route Conversation\n\nDecides whether the message is a Slack-share follow-up or a new finance question."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"050b74aa-3604-4ee0-89a1-6928885cd5ed","name":"Section 5a. Slack Share Follow-ups","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[2944,192],"parameters":{"color":2,"width":768,"height":1024,"content":"## 5a. Slack Share Follow-ups\n\nPosts the previous answer to Slack on 'Yes', cancels on 'No', or explains there is no previous answer to post."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"eca2aa13-61bd-4b48-9528-e51065cb1e0f","name":"Section 5b. Classify Finance Intent","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[2944,1312],"parameters":{"width":1056,"height":576,"content":"## 5b. Classify Finance Intent\n\nOpenAI classifies the request; the parsed intent is routed. Unknown or failed classification returns a help reply."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"e0f97f4d-78ec-40e1-8f8a-f0f6d2689a9a","name":"Section 6. Prepare Xero Context","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[4096,1312],"parameters":{"color":5,"width":1056,"height":576,"content":"## 6. Prepare Xero Context\n\nFetches connected Xero organisations, selects the tenant, checks readiness and routes to the right report."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"cd127a45-735d-4f66-a64d-440ff8705e69","name":"Section 7a. Xero Receivables","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[5536,1088],"parameters":{"color":6,"width":480,"height":352,"content":"## 7a. Xero Receivables\n\nRetrieves unpaid customer invoices and builds a receivables summary."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"55f1e3dd-0fc8-4c10-911d-0ced4679eecc","name":"Section 7b. Xero Cash Position","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[5248,1536],"parameters":{"color":6,"width":768,"height":352,"content":"## 7b. Xero Cash Position\n\nRetrieves active bank accounts and the bank summary report, then builds a cash position summary."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"b7bd7342-7d20-494c-a95a-eda3f9cbaa7a","name":"Section 7c. Xero Payable Bills","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[5536,1984],"parameters":{"color":6,"width":480,"height":352,"content":"## 7c. Xero Payable Bills\n\nRetrieves unpaid supplier bills and keeps those due this week."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"bbe20989-81a4-4c67-b5c1-6768894e7a2e","name":"Section 7d. Xero API Errors","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[6112,2432],"parameters":{"color":3,"width":480,"height":352,"content":"## 7d. Xero API Errors\n\nAny failed Xero request ends here with a standard user-facing message."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"bdcbfcf5-913a-40ef-a169-3cde591ce956","name":"Section 8. Draft & Validate Response","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[6112,1536],"parameters":{"color":4,"width":768,"height":576,"content":"## 8. Draft & Validate Response\n\nCompiles the report, asks OpenAI to word it, validates every figure, and falls back to the canonical text if anything differs."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"baeef169-9b5c-4c43-b054-0ed028847d00","name":"Section 9. Persist Conversation State","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[6976,1536],"parameters":{"color":7,"width":768,"height":352,"content":"## 9. Persist Conversation State\n\nEvery path converges here: builds the state record, saves it to the data table, and restores the reply payload."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"82775209-14ef-4ec8-bc00-323b4f2cc043","name":"Section 10. Send Channel Response","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[7840,1424],"parameters":{"color":2,"width":480,"height":576,"content":"## 10. Send Channel Response\n\nRoutes the reply to the originating channel: WhatsApp via WAHA or Telegram."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"8cb81b71-8134-41db-bf67-21cd42cf40be","name":"Receive WhatsApp Message (WAHA Webhook)","type":"n8n-nodes-base.webhook","position":[-176,1152],"webhookId":"finance-bot-waha-v1","parameters":{"path":"finance-bot-waha","options":{"rawBody":true},"httpMethod":"POST"},"typeVersion":2},{"id":"8d181b06-5a6b-4d96-b37b-8a1b72cbd7fa","name":"Compute WAHA HMAC-SHA512","type":"n8n-nodes-base.crypto","position":[112,1152],"parameters":{"type":"SHA512","action":"hmac","binaryData":true,"dataPropertyName":"wahaComputedHmac"},"typeVersion":2},{"id":"b7617b01-3ed6-4836-b54f-cccec04e13d9","name":"Is WAHA Signature Valid?","type":"n8n-nodes-base.if","position":[400,1152],"parameters":{"options":{},"conditions":{"options":{"version":1,"leftValue":"","caseSensitive":true,"typeValidation":"strict"},"combinator":"and","conditions":[{"id":"waha-hmac-match","operator":{"type":"string","operation":"equals"},"leftValue":"={{ $json.wahaComputedHmac }}","rightValue":"={{ $json.headers['x-webhook-hmac'] || '' }}"},{"id":"waha-hmac-algorithm","operator":{"type":"string","operation":"equals"},"leftValue":"={{ ($json.headers['x-webhook-hmac-algorithm'] || '').toLowerCase() }}","rightValue":"sha512"}]}},"typeVersion":2},{"id":"86c5bbfe-0dc2-4d43-8861-51fdac95871c","name":"Receive Telegram Message","type":"n8n-nodes-base.telegramTrigger","position":[400,1376],"webhookId":"658ff35f-7db6-4baf-8ed2-e2521ecec9fb","parameters":{"updates":["message"],"additionalFields":{}},"typeVersion":1.5},{"id":"6b6e0e80-14e9-421f-a3db-2b74660bef7f","name":"Normalize Channel Message","type":"n8n-nodes-base.code","position":[688,1264],"parameters":{"jsCode":"const source = $input.first().json;\nconst isTelegram = !!source.message?.chat?.id;\nif (isTelegram) {\n  const m = source.message;\n  const text = String(m.text || m.caption || '').trim();\n  if (!text || m.from?.is_bot) return [];\n  return [{ json: {\n    channel: 'telegram',\n    userId: String(m.from?.id || ''),\n    chatId: String(m.chat.id),\n    messageId: String(m.message_id || ''),\n    messageText: text,\n    timestamp: new Date(Number(m.date || Math.floor(Date.now() / 1000)) * 1000).toISOString(),\n    wahaSession: '',\n  }}];\n}\n\nconst body = source.body || {};\nconst p = body.payload || {};\nif (body.event !== 'message' || p.fromMe === true) return [];\nconst text = String(p.body || p.text || '').trim();\nif (!text) return [];\nconst chatId = String(p.from || p.chatId || '');\nconst userId = String(p.participant || p.author || chatId);\nif (!chatId || !userId) return [];\nconst rawTs = Number(p.timestamp || body.timestamp || Date.now());\nconst tsMs = rawTs < 1+1234567890 ? rawTs * 1000 : rawTs;\nreturn [{ json: {\n  channel: 'whatsapp',\n  userId,\n  chatId,\n  messageId: String(p.id || body.id || ''),\n  messageText: text,\n  timestamp: new Date(tsMs).toISOString(),\n  wahaSession: String(body.session || 'default'),\n}}];"},"typeVersion":2},{"id":"afbe57ee-cba3-4c08-82ac-7e4acb2333bf","name":"Set Workflow Config (Users, Slack, Xero)","type":"n8n-nodes-base.code","position":[976,1264],"parameters":{"jsCode":"const d = $input.first().json;\n// Non-secret deployment settings. Replace the placeholder values before activation.\nconst config = {\n  wahaBaseUrl: 'https://waha.intuz.net',\n  slackChannelId: 'C0C584LKFGA',\n  allowedUsers: [\n    'telegram:8983620388',\n  'whatsapp:218442221256710@lid',\n  ],\n  // Leave blank when this OAuth credential has exactly one Xero organisation.\n  xeroTenantId: '',\n};\nreturn [{ json: { ...d, config } }];"},"typeVersion":2},{"id":"95d8b031-240a-46c2-9953-a6cb600aee67","name":"Build Authorization Result","type":"n8n-nodes-base.code","position":[1264,1264],"parameters":{"jsCode":"const d = $input.first().json;\nconst allowed = new Set((Array.isArray(d.config?.allowedUsers) ? d.config.allowedUsers : [])\n  .map(v => String(v).trim())\n  .filter(v => v && !v.startsWith('REPLACE_')));\nconst userKey = d.channel + ':' + d.userId;\nconst chatKey = d.channel + ':' + d.chatId;\nconst authorized = allowed.has(userKey) || allowed.has(chatKey) || allowed.has(d.channel + ':*');\nreturn [{ json: {\n  ...d,\n  stateKey: d.channel + ':' + d.chatId + ':' + d.userId,\n  authorized,\n  replyText: authorized ? '' : 'You are not authorized to access this finance bot. Please contact the workflow administrator.',\n}}];"},"typeVersion":2},{"id":"0596d872-21c0-4f92-9058-9f8a0adafc57","name":"Is User Authorized?","type":"n8n-nodes-base.if","position":[1552,1264],"parameters":{"options":{},"conditions":{"options":{"version":1,"leftValue":"","caseSensitive":true,"typeValidation":"strict"},"combinator":"and","conditions":[{"id":"authorized-user","operator":{"type":"boolean","operation":"true","singleValue":true},"leftValue":"={{ $json.authorized }}","rightValue":true}]}},"typeVersion":2},{"id":"0839cd3e-6aa4-4b1b-a93a-984994125dfb","name":"Load Conversation State","type":"n8n-nodes-base.dataTable","onError":"continueErrorOutput","position":[1840,1264],"parameters":{"limit":1,"filters":{"conditions":[{"keyName":"stateKey","keyValue":"={{ $('Build Authorization Result').item.json.stateKey }}"}]},"matchType":"allConditions","operation":"get","dataTableId":{"__rl":true,"mode":"name","value":"Finance Bot Conversation State"}},"typeVersion":1.1,"alwaysOutputData":true},{"id":"56c02125-e2ab-42a8-a85e-983246e0ed78","name":"Merge Message with Saved State","type":"n8n-nodes-base.code","position":[2128,1264],"parameters":{"jsCode":"const incoming = $('Build Authorization Result').first().json;\nconst row = $input.first().json || {};\nreturn [{ json: {\n  ...incoming,\n  lastIntent: String(row.lastIntent || ''),\n  lastResponse: String(row.lastResponse || ''),\n  pendingSlackConfirmation: row.pendingSlackConfirmation === true,\n  stateUpdatedAt: row.updatedAt || null,\n}}];"},"typeVersion":2},{"id":"d6d997ba-3978-4dae-8980-0c0aacf9800a","name":"Prepare State Load Error Reply","type":"n8n-nodes-base.code","position":[2128,1488],"parameters":{"jsCode":"const d = $('Build Authorization Result').first().json;\nreturn [{ json: { ...d, replyText: 'I could not load your conversation state right now. Please try again later.' } }];"},"typeVersion":2},{"id":"e3952c87-d994-4b58-a9d6-b989bab81f4b","name":"Determine Conversation Route","type":"n8n-nodes-base.code","position":[2416,1264],"parameters":{"jsCode":"const d = $input.first().json;\nconst text = d.messageText.trim().toLowerCase().replace(/[.!?]+$/g, '').trim();\nconst yes = /^(yes|yes please|sure|okay|ok|please do|go ahead)$/.test(text);\nconst no = /^(no|no thanks|no thank you|don't|do not|cancel)$/.test(text);\nconst post = /^(post it|share it|post this to slack|send this to slack|send that to slack|send to slack|share to slack)$/.test(text);\nlet route = 'classify';\nif (d.pendingSlackConfirmation && yes) route = 'slack_post';\nelse if (d.pendingSlackConfirmation && no) route = 'slack_no';\nelse if (post && d.lastResponse) route = 'slack_post';\nelse if (post) route = 'no_previous';\nreturn [{ json: { ...d, route } }];"},"typeVersion":2},{"id":"23fb5791-c0a3-4dae-b15d-4b110676cf95","name":"Route: Slack Follow-up or New Request","type":"n8n-nodes-base.switch","position":[2704,1264],"parameters":{"mode":"expression","output":"={{ ({ slack_post: 0, slack_no: 1, no_previous: 2, classify: 3 })[$json.route] ?? 3 }}"},"typeVersion":3.4},{"id":"2aa85baa-3aa0-4dd2-879d-264a3e5fca6a","name":"Prepare Slack Share Message","type":"n8n-nodes-base.code","position":[2992,480],"parameters":{"jsCode":"const d = $input.first().json;\nreturn [{ json: { ...d, slackText: d.lastResponse, pendingSlackConfirmation: false } }];"},"typeVersion":2},{"id":"fc424661-e0a8-4be9-bc82-caa35355d6b4","name":"Post Answer to Slack","type":"n8n-nodes-base.slack","onError":"continueErrorOutput","maxTries":3,"position":[3280,480],"webhookId":"646585dd-e625-4743-8764-d2195174460b","parameters":{"text":"={{ $json.slackText }}","select":"channel","channelId":{"__rl":true,"mode":"id","value":"={{ $json.config.slackChannelId }}"},"otherOptions":{"includeLinkToWorkflow":false}},"retryOnFail":true,"typeVersion":2.7,"waitBetweenTries":2000},{"id":"431bfbd2-54d0-43b4-aebc-1bd02da848e1","name":"Prepare Slack Success Reply","type":"n8n-nodes-base.code","position":[3568,368],"parameters":{"jsCode":"const d = $('Prepare Slack Share Message').first().json;\nreturn [{ json: { ...d, replyText: \"Done. I've posted the finance update to Slack.\", pendingSlackConfirmation: false } }];"},"typeVersion":2},{"id":"5a8fd99d-1f6c-4831-9af4-99692adaa85d","name":"Prepare Slack Failure Reply","type":"n8n-nodes-base.code","position":[3568,592],"parameters":{"jsCode":"const d = $('Prepare Slack Share Message').first().json;\nreturn [{ json: { ...d, replyText: \"I generated the finance report, but I couldn't post it to Slack right now.\", pendingSlackConfirmation: false } }];"},"typeVersion":2},{"id":"f6c22bd6-75dc-4a8e-8095-b9b11ef95ade","name":"Prepare Slack Declined Reply","type":"n8n-nodes-base.code","position":[2992,816],"parameters":{"jsCode":"const d = $input.first().json;\nreturn [{ json: { ...d, replyText: \"No problem. I won't post it to Slack.\", pendingSlackConfirmation: false } }];"},"typeVersion":2},{"id":"fe3a0925-6b02-460d-a0b4-1108d07123c1","name":"Prepare No Previous Answer Reply","type":"n8n-nodes-base.code","position":[2992,1040],"parameters":{"jsCode":"const d = $input.first().json;\nreturn [{ json: { ...d, replyText: \"I don't have a previous finance answer to post. Please ask your finance question first.\", pendingSlackConfirmation: false } }];"},"typeVersion":2},{"id":"fabb4a63-c93c-4836-b564-407d72736db1","name":"OpenAI: Classify Finance Intent","type":"@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.openAi","onError":"continueErrorOutput","maxTries":3,"position":[2992,1488],"parameters":{"modelId":{"__rl":true,"mode":"list","value":"gpt-4o-mini"},"options":{"temperature":0},"messages":{"values":[{"role":"system","content":"You are a finance request classifier. Classify the user message into exactly one of: accounts_receivable, cash_position, bills_due_this_week, slack_confirmation, unknown. Do not answer the financial question. Never infer financial numbers. Return valid JSON only in the shape {\"intent\":\"...\"}."},{"content":"=User message: {{ $json.messageText }}"}]},"jsonOutput":true},"retryOnFail":true,"typeVersion":1.8,"waitBetweenTries":2000},{"id":"f7e24952-43be-4c3f-bbe3-a9bb281d36d8","name":"Parse Intent from AI Output","type":"n8n-nodes-base.code","position":[3280,1488],"parameters":{"jsCode":"const base = $('Determine Conversation Route').first().json;\nlet raw = $input.first().json;\nraw = raw.message?.content ?? raw.text ?? raw.choices?.[0]?.message?.content ?? raw.output ?? raw;\nif (typeof raw === 'string') {\n  const clean = raw.replace(/^```json\\s*/i, '').replace(/```$/i, '').trim();\n  try { raw = JSON.parse(clean); } catch { raw = { intent: 'unknown' }; }\n}\nconst allowed = new Set(['accounts_receivable','cash_position','bills_due_this_week','slack_confirmation','unknown']);\nconst intent = allowed.has(raw.intent) ? raw.intent : 'unknown';\nreturn [{ json: { ...base, intent } }];"},"typeVersion":2},{"id":"2371cd36-945a-4dc4-b51d-ca95e15f84a5","name":"Prepare Intent Classification Error Reply","type":"n8n-nodes-base.code","position":[3280,1712],"parameters":{"jsCode":"const d = $('Determine Conversation Route').first().json;\nreturn [{ json: { ...d, replyText: \"I couldn't understand that request. Please try asking about receivables, cash position, or bills due this week.\" } }];"},"typeVersion":2},{"id":"b26cd067-549c-403d-9fc8-150b103352c6","name":"Route: By Finance Intent","type":"n8n-nodes-base.switch","position":[3568,1488],"parameters":{"mode":"expression","output":"={{ ({ accounts_receivable: 0, cash_position: 1, bills_due_this_week: 2 })[$json.intent] ?? 3 }}"},"typeVersion":3.4},{"id":"98edeb81-3231-4dde-80fc-104dea8ab95d","name":"Prepare Unknown Intent Help Reply","type":"n8n-nodes-base.code","position":[3856,1712],"parameters":{"jsCode":"const d = $input.first().json;\nreturn [{ json: { ...d, lastIntent: 'unknown', replyText: 'I can currently help with:\\n\\n• Who owes you money\\n• Your current cash position\\n• Bills due this week\\n\\nPlease ask me one of these finance questions.' } }];"},"typeVersion":2},{"id":"270eed16-a841-4897-943d-6ab8b6d17017","name":"Xero: Get Connected Organisations","type":"n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest","onError":"continueErrorOutput","maxTries":2,"position":[4144,1488],"parameters":{"url":"https://api.xero.com/connections","options":{"timeout":30000,"response":{"response":{"responseFormat":"json"}}},"authentication":"genericCredentialType","genericAuthType":"oAuth2Api"},"retryOnFail":true,"typeVersion":4.5,"waitBetweenTries":1500},{"id":"0f4f1b0d-7d89-42c7-8970-720283ef8ac5","name":"Select Xero Tenant","type":"n8n-nodes-base.code","position":[4432,1488],"parameters":{"jsCode":"const base = $('Parse Intent from AI Output').first().json;\nconst values = $input.all().flatMap(i => Array.isArray(i.json) ? i.json : [i.json]);\nconst preferred = String(base.config?.xeroTenantId || '').trim();\nconst connection = preferred ? values.find(v => String(v.tenantId) === preferred) : (values.length === 1 ? values[0] : null);\nreturn [{ json: {\n  ...base,\n  tenantId: String(connection?.tenantId || ''),\n  tenantName: String(connection?.tenantName || ''),\n  xeroReady: !!connection?.tenantId,\n  xeroContextError: connection?.tenantId ? '' : (values.length > 1 ? 'Multiple Xero organisations are connected. Set xeroTenantId in Workflow Configuration.' : 'No Xero organisation connection was found.'),\n}}];"},"typeVersion":2},{"id":"fa97f40e-9bc3-45d2-ad10-8558b373a2f1","name":"Prepare Xero Connection Error Reply","type":"n8n-nodes-base.code","position":[4432,1712],"parameters":{"jsCode":"const d = $('Parse Intent from AI Output').first().json;\nreturn [{ json: { ...d, replyText: \"I couldn't connect to Xero right now. Please check the Xero connection.\" } }];"},"typeVersion":2},{"id":"23a80466-d130-4f34-a17b-8b5e280e3e4a","name":"Is Xero Tenant Ready?","type":"n8n-nodes-base.if","position":[4720,1488],"parameters":{"options":{},"conditions":{"options":{"version":1,"leftValue":"","caseSensitive":true,"typeValidation":"strict"},"combinator":"and","conditions":[{"id":"xero-ready","operator":{"type":"boolean","operation":"true","singleValue":true},"leftValue":"={{ $json.xeroReady }}","rightValue":true}]}},"typeVersion":2},{"id":"06ce26d6-14ba-4b17-8316-9ec6490724f8","name":"Prepare Xero Tenant Error Reply","type":"n8n-nodes-base.code","position":[5008,1712],"parameters":{"jsCode":"const d = $input.first().json;\nreturn [{ json: { ...d, replyText: \"I couldn't connect to Xero right now. Please check the Xero connection and tenant selection.\" } }];"},"typeVersion":2},{"id":"12407634-896c-4bab-a27e-9974c0295726","name":"Route: Xero Report Type","type":"n8n-nodes-base.switch","position":[5008,1488],"parameters":{"mode":"expression","output":"={{ ({ accounts_receivable: 0, cash_position: 1, bills_due_this_week: 2 })[$json.intent] ?? 0 }}","numberOutputs":3},"typeVersion":3.4},{"id":"678a5354-fedf-495e-a937-0a03c6b081e7","name":"Xero: Get Receivable Invoices","type":"n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest","onError":"continueErrorOutput","maxTries":3,"position":[5584,1264],"parameters":{"url":"https://api.xero.com/api.xro/2.0/Invoices","options":{"timeout":60000,"response":{"response":{"responseFormat":"json"}},"pagination":{"pagination":{"parameters":{"parameters":[{"name":"page","value":"={{ $pageCount + 1 }}"}]},"requestInterval":250,"limitPagesFetched":true,"completeExpression":"={{ ($response.body.Invoices || []).length < 100 }}","paginationCompleteWhen":"other"}}},"sendQuery":true,"sendHeaders":true,"authentication":"genericCredentialType","genericAuthType":"oAuth2Api","queryParameters":{"parameters":[{"name":"where","value":"Type==\"ACCREC\"&&AmountDue>0"},{"name":"pageSize","value":"100"},{"name":"order","value":"DueDate ASC"}]},"headerParameters":{"parameters":[{"name":"xero-tenant-id","value":"={{ $json.tenantId }}"},{"name":"Accept","value":"application/json"}]}},"retryOnFail":true,"typeVersion":4.5,"waitBetweenTries":2000},{"id":"1c9fb63f-0bfe-414b-b9eb-c9034318b061","name":"Xero: Get Bank Accounts","type":"n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest","onError":"continueErrorOutput","maxTries":3,"position":[5296,1712],"parameters":{"url":"https://api.xero.com/api.xro/2.0/Accounts","options":{"timeout":60000,"response":{"response":{"responseFormat":"json"}}},"sendQuery":true,"sendHeaders":true,"authentication":"genericCredentialType","genericAuthType":"oAuth2Api","queryParameters":{"parameters":[{"name":"where","value":"Type==\"BANK\"&&Status==\"ACTIVE\""}]},"headerParameters":{"parameters":[{"name":"xero-tenant-id","value":"={{ $json.tenantId }}"},{"name":"Accept","value":"application/json"}]}},"retryOnFail":true,"typeVersion":4.5,"waitBetweenTries":2000},{"id":"56b750fb-ba72-44e0-bda9-86491314a670","name":"Xero: Get Bank Summary Report","type":"n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest","onError":"continueErrorOutput","maxTries":3,"position":[5584,1712],"parameters":{"url":"https://api.xero.com/api.xro/2.0/Reports/BankSummary","options":{"timeout":60000,"response":{"response":{"responseFormat":"json"}}},"sendQuery":true,"sendHeaders":true,"authentication":"genericCredentialType","genericAuthType":"oAuth2Api","queryParameters":{"parameters":[{"name":"fromDate","value":"={{ $now.toISODate() }}"},{"name":"toDate","value":"={{ $now.toISODate() }}"}]},"headerParameters":{"parameters":[{"name":"xero-tenant-id","value":"={{ $('Select Xero Tenant').first().json.tenantId }}"},{"name":"Accept","value":"application/json"}]}},"retryOnFail":true,"typeVersion":4.5,"waitBetweenTries":2000},{"id":"860ccf6a-24c3-4d65-b619-1b524a5e42a7","name":"Xero: Get Payable Bills","type":"n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest","onError":"continueErrorOutput","maxTries":3,"position":[5584,2160],"parameters":{"url":"https://api.xero.com/api.xro/2.0/Invoices","options":{"timeout":60000,"response":{"response":{"responseFormat":"json"}},"pagination":{"pagination":{"parameters":{"parameters":[{"name":"page","value":"={{ $pageCount + 1 }}"}]},"requestInterval":250,"limitPagesFetched":true,"completeExpression":"={{ ($response.body.Invoices || []).length < 100 }}","paginationCompleteWhen":"other"}}},"sendQuery":true,"sendHeaders":true,"authentication":"genericCredentialType","genericAuthType":"oAuth2Api","queryParameters":{"parameters":[{"name":"where","value":"Type==\"ACCPAY\"&&AmountDue>0"},{"name":"pageSize","value":"100"},{"name":"order","value":"DueDate ASC"}]},"headerParameters":{"parameters":[{"name":"xero-tenant-id","value":"={{ $json.tenantId }}"},{"name":"Accept","value":"application/json"}]}},"retryOnFail":true,"typeVersion":4.5,"waitBetweenTries":2000},{"id":"a37fd536-df19-4dcf-a5d0-c139c4254f76","name":"Summarize Receivables","type":"n8n-nodes-base.code","position":[5872,1264],"parameters":{"jsCode":"function objectsFromInput(items, key) {\n  const out = [];\n  for (const item of items) {\n    const j = item.json || {};\n    if (Array.isArray(j)) for (const page of j) out.push(...(page?.[key] || []));\n    else if (Array.isArray(j[key])) out.push(...j[key]);\n    else if (Array.isArray(j.body?.[key])) out.push(...j.body[key]);\n  }\n  return out;\n}\nfunction isoDate(value) {\n  if (!value) return '';\n  const s = String(value);\n  const m = s.match(/Date\\((\\d+)/);\n  if (m) return new Date(Number(m[1])).toISOString().slice(0, 10);\n  const d = new Date(s);\n  return Number.isNaN(d.getTime()) ? s.slice(0, 10) : d.toISOString().slice(0, 10);\n}\nfunction money(value, currency) {\n  const amount = Number(value || 0);\n  try { return new Intl.NumberFormat('en', { style: 'currency', currency, minimumFractionDigits: 2, maximumFractionDigits: 2 }).format(amount); }\n  catch { return amount.toFixed(2) + ' ' + (currency || ''); }\n}\nconst base = $('Select Xero Tenant').first().json;\nconst today = $now.toISODate();\nconst invoices = objectsFromInput($input.all(), 'Invoices').filter(i => i.Type === 'ACCREC' && Number(i.AmountDue || 0) > 0 && !['VOIDED','DELETED','PAID'].includes(i.Status));\nconst records = invoices.map(i => ({\n  customer: i.Contact?.Name || 'Unknown customer', invoiceNumber: i.InvoiceNumber || '', invoiceDate: isoDate(i.DateString || i.Date),\n  dueDate: isoDate(i.DueDateString || i.DueDate), invoiceTotal: Number(i.Total || 0), amountPaid: Number(i.AmountPaid || 0),\n  amountDue: Number(i.AmountDue || 0), currency: i.CurrencyCode || 'UNKNOWN', status: i.Status || '',\n  overdue: !!isoDate(i.DueDateString || i.DueDate) && isoDate(i.DueDateString || i.DueDate) < today,\n}));\nconst totals = {};\nfor (const r of records) { totals[r.currency] ??= { outstanding: 0, overdue: 0 }; totals[r.currency].outstanding += r.amountDue; if (r.overdue) totals[r.currency].overdue += r.amountDue; }\nlet lines = ['Outstanding payments:', ''];\nfor (const r of records) lines.push('• ' + r.customer + (r.invoiceNumber ? ' (' + r.invoiceNumber + ')' : '') + ' — ' + money(r.amountDue, r.currency) + ' — ' + (r.overdue ? 'overdue' : 'due ' + r.dueDate));\nif (!records.length) lines = [\"I couldn't find any matching records in Xero.\"];\nelse { lines.push(''); for (const [c,t] of Object.entries(totals)) { lines.push('Total outstanding (' + c + '): ' + money(t.outstanding,c)); if (t.overdue > 0) lines.push('Total overdue (' + c + '): ' + money(t.overdue,c)); } }\nreturn [{ json: { ...base, financeData: { intent: base.intent, records, totals }, safeFallback: lines.join('\\n'), requiredTokens: records.flatMap(r => [r.customer, r.invoiceNumber, money(r.amountDue,r.currency), r.dueDate].filter(Boolean)).concat(Object.entries(totals).map(([c,t]) => money(t.outstanding,c))) } }];"},"typeVersion":2},{"id":"13031871-6bcb-4a52-9490-16f156798286","name":"Summarize Cash Position","type":"n8n-nodes-base.code","position":[5872,1712],"parameters":{"jsCode":"function objectsFromInput(items, key) {\n  const out = [];\n  for (const item of items) {\n    const j = item.json || {};\n    if (Array.isArray(j)) for (const page of j) out.push(...(page?.[key] || []));\n    else if (Array.isArray(j[key])) out.push(...j[key]);\n    else if (Array.isArray(j.body?.[key])) out.push(...j.body[key]);\n  }\n  return out;\n}\nfunction isoDate(value) {\n  if (!value) return '';\n  const s = String(value);\n  const m = s.match(/Date\\((\\d+)/);\n  if (m) return new Date(Number(m[1])).toISOString().slice(0, 10);\n  const d = new Date(s);\n  return Number.isNaN(d.getTime()) ? s.slice(0, 10) : d.toISOString().slice(0, 10);\n}\nfunction money(value, currency) {\n  const amount = Number(value || 0);\n  try { return new Intl.NumberFormat('en', { style: 'currency', currency, minimumFractionDigits: 2, maximumFractionDigits: 2 }).format(amount); }\n  catch { return amount.toFixed(2) + ' ' + (currency || ''); }\n}\nconst base = $('Select Xero Tenant').first().json;\nconst accountNode = $('Xero: Get Bank Accounts').first().json;\nconst accounts = (accountNode.Accounts || accountNode.body?.Accounts || []).filter(a => a.Status === 'ACTIVE' && a.Type === 'BANK' && a.BankAccountType !== 'CREDITCARD');\nconst byId = new Map(accounts.map(a => [String(a.AccountID), a]));\nconst reportInput = $input.first().json;\nconst reports = reportInput.Reports || reportInput.body?.Reports || [];\nconst rows = reports.flatMap(r => r.Rows || []).flatMap(r => r.RowType === 'Section' ? (r.Rows || []) : []);\nconst records = [];\nfor (const row of rows) {\n  if (row.RowType !== 'Row' || !row.Cells?.length) continue;\n  const id = String((row.Cells[0].Attributes || []).find(a => String(a.Id).toLowerCase() === 'accountid')?.Value || '');\n  const account = byId.get(id);\n  if (!account) continue;\n  const balance = Number(String(row.Cells[4]?.Value || '0').replace(/,/g, ''));\n  if (!Number.isFinite(balance)) continue;\n  records.push({ accountName: account.Name || row.Cells[0].Value || 'Bank account', accountId: id, balance, currency: account.CurrencyCode || 'UNKNOWN' });\n}\nconst totals = {};\nfor (const r of records) totals[r.currency] = (totals[r.currency] || 0) + r.balance;\nlet lines = ['Current cash position:', ''];\nfor (const r of records) lines.push('• ' + r.accountName + ': ' + money(r.balance, r.currency));\nif (!records.length) lines = [\"I couldn't find any matching bank balances in Xero.\"];\nelse { lines.push(''); for (const [c,t] of Object.entries(totals)) lines.push('Total cash (' + c + '): ' + money(t,c)); if (Object.keys(totals).length > 1) lines.push('Different currencies are shown separately and are not combined.'); }\nreturn [{ json: { ...base, financeData: { intent: base.intent, records, totals }, safeFallback: lines.join('\\n'), requiredTokens: records.flatMap(r => [r.accountName, money(r.balance,r.currency)]).concat(Object.entries(totals).map(([c,t]) => money(t,c))) } }];"},"typeVersion":2},{"id":"d118ee3d-8526-48a9-8d43-da8dcfb847dc","name":"Summarize Bills Due This Week","type":"n8n-nodes-base.code","position":[5872,2160],"parameters":{"jsCode":"function objectsFromInput(items, key) {\n  const out = [];\n  for (const item of items) {\n    const j = item.json || {};\n    if (Array.isArray(j)) for (const page of j) out.push(...(page?.[key] || []));\n    else if (Array.isArray(j[key])) out.push(...j[key]);\n    else if (Array.isArray(j.body?.[key])) out.push(...j.body[key]);\n  }\n  return out;\n}\nfunction isoDate(value) {\n  if (!value) return '';\n  const s = String(value);\n  const m = s.match(/Date\\((\\d+)/);\n  if (m) return new Date(Number(m[1])).toISOString().slice(0, 10);\n  const d = new Date(s);\n  return Number.isNaN(d.getTime()) ? s.slice(0, 10) : d.toISOString().slice(0, 10);\n}\nfunction money(value, currency) {\n  const amount = Number(value || 0);\n  try { return new Intl.NumberFormat('en', { style: 'currency', currency, minimumFractionDigits: 2, maximumFractionDigits: 2 }).format(amount); }\n  catch { return amount.toFixed(2) + ' ' + (currency || ''); }\n}\nconst base = $('Select Xero Tenant').first().json;\nconst start = $now.startOf('week').toISODate();\nconst end = $now.endOf('week').toISODate();\nconst invoices = objectsFromInput($input.all(), 'Invoices').filter(i => i.Type === 'ACCPAY' && Number(i.AmountDue || 0) > 0 && !['VOIDED','DELETED','PAID'].includes(i.Status));\nconst records = invoices.map(i => ({ supplier: i.Contact?.Name || 'Unknown supplier', invoiceNumber: i.InvoiceNumber || '', dueDate: isoDate(i.DueDateString || i.DueDate), amountDue: Number(i.AmountDue || 0), currency: i.CurrencyCode || 'UNKNOWN' })).filter(r => r.dueDate >= start && r.dueDate <= end);\nconst totals = {};\nfor (const r of records) totals[r.currency] = (totals[r.currency] || 0) + r.amountDue;\nlet lines = ['Bills due this week (' + start + ' to ' + end + '):', ''];\nfor (const r of records) lines.push('• ' + r.supplier + (r.invoiceNumber ? ' (' + r.invoiceNumber + ')' : '') + ' — ' + money(r.amountDue,r.currency) + ' — due ' + r.dueDate);\nif (!records.length) lines = [\"I couldn't find any matching bills due this week in Xero.\"];\nelse { lines.push(''); for (const [c,t] of Object.entries(totals)) lines.push('Total due this week (' + c + '): ' + money(t,c)); }\nreturn [{ json: { ...base, financeData: { intent: base.intent, week: { start, end }, records, totals }, safeFallback: lines.join('\\n'), requiredTokens: records.flatMap(r => [r.supplier, r.invoiceNumber, money(r.amountDue,r.currency), r.dueDate].filter(Boolean)).concat(Object.entries(totals).map(([c,t]) => money(t,c))) } }];"},"typeVersion":2},{"id":"e77c84d1-39a7-47da-923c-d4ac9dd1c395","name":"Compile Finance Report Payload","type":"n8n-nodes-base.code","position":[6160,1712],"parameters":{"jsCode":"const d = $input.first().json;\nreturn [{ json: d }];"},"typeVersion":2},{"id":"a4c0eff4-f47e-4efa-9397-a1d806cd5033","name":"OpenAI: Write Finance Response","type":"@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.openAi","onError":"continueErrorOutput","maxTries":3,"position":[6448,1712],"parameters":{"modelId":{"__rl":true,"mode":"list","value":"gpt-4o-mini"},"options":{"temperature":0},"messages":{"values":[{"role":"system","content":"You are a business finance assistant. Return JSON only as {\"response\":\"...\"}. Use ONLY the supplied canonical Xero report. Preserve every name, date, currency, and number exactly. Do not calculate, invent, omit, round, or alter financial values. Keep it concise and suitable for WhatsApp/Telegram. If uncertain, copy canonicalText exactly."},{"content":"=Intent: {{ $json.intent }}\nCanonical text (source of truth):\n{{ $json.safeFallback }}\n\nStructured Xero data:\n{{ JSON.stringify($json.financeData) }}"}]},"jsonOutput":true},"retryOnFail":true,"typeVersion":1.8,"waitBetweenTries":2000},{"id":"04d59be9-6888-4f92-826e-06fda0b7c64c","name":"Validate AI Response","type":"n8n-nodes-base.code","position":[6736,1712],"parameters":{"jsCode":"const base = $('Compile Finance Report Payload').first().json;\nlet raw = $input.first().json;\nraw = raw.message?.content ?? raw.text ?? raw.choices?.[0]?.message?.content ?? raw.output ?? raw;\nif (typeof raw === 'string') {\n  const clean = raw.replace(/^```json\\s*/i, '').replace(/```$/i, '').trim();\n  try { raw = JSON.parse(clean); } catch { raw = { response: clean }; }\n}\nlet response = String(raw.response || '').trim();\nconst fallback = String(base.safeFallback || '');\nconst missing = (base.requiredTokens || []).some(t => t && !response.includes(String(t)));\nconst numbers = s => (String(s).match(/-?\\d[\\d,]*(?:\\.\\d+)?/g) || []).map(v => v.replace(/,/g,''));\nconst allowedNumbers = new Set(numbers(fallback));\nconst inventedNumber = numbers(response).some(n => !allowedNumbers.has(n));\nif (!response || missing || inventedNumber) response = fallback;\nconst prompt = '\\n\\nWould you like me to post this to Slack?\\nReply \"Yes\" to post it.';\nreturn [{ json: { ...base, lastIntent: base.intent, lastResponse: response, pendingSlackConfirmation: true, replyText: response + prompt } }];"},"typeVersion":2},{"id":"3472d587-ca2b-4f08-937e-1406d70cc44a","name":"Use Safe Fallback Response","type":"n8n-nodes-base.code","position":[6736,1936],"parameters":{"jsCode":"const d = $('Compile Finance Report Payload').first().json;\nconst response = d.safeFallback;\nreturn [{ json: { ...d, lastIntent: d.intent, lastResponse: response, pendingSlackConfirmation: true, replyText: response + '\\n\\nWould you like me to post this to Slack?\\nReply \"Yes\" to post it.' } }];"},"typeVersion":2},{"id":"deb4dbd1-bd1a-4a3b-8204-47468b9e75bb","name":"Prepare Xero API Error Reply","type":"n8n-nodes-base.code","position":[6160,2608],"parameters":{"jsCode":"let d;\ntry { d = $('Select Xero Tenant').first().json; } catch { d = $('Parse Intent from AI Output').first().json; }\nreturn [{ json: { ...d, replyText: \"I couldn't retrieve the financial information from Xero right now. Please try again later.\" } }];"},"typeVersion":2},{"id":"16188254-fa08-4410-9945-90c3e6e3ee13","name":"Build Conversation State Record","type":"n8n-nodes-base.code","position":[7024,1712],"parameters":{"jsCode":"const d = $input.first().json;\nreturn [{ json: {\n  ...d,\n  stateKey: d.stateKey,\n  lastIntent: String(d.lastIntent || ''),\n  lastResponse: String(d.lastResponse || ''),\n  pendingSlackConfirmation: d.pendingSlackConfirmation === true,\n  updatedAt: new Date().toISOString(),\n}}];"},"typeVersion":2},{"id":"f6badd79-4960-4858-88b6-47887a426f29","name":"Save Conversation State","type":"n8n-nodes-base.dataTable","onError":"continueErrorOutput","position":[7312,1712],"parameters":{"columns":{"value":{"chatId":"={{ $json.chatId }}","userId":"={{ $json.userId }}","channel":"={{ $json.channel }}","stateKey":"={{ $json.stateKey }}","lastIntent":"={{ $json.lastIntent }}","lastResponse":"={{ $json.lastResponse }}","pendingSlackConfirmation":"={{ $json.pendingSlackConfirmation }}"},"schema":[{"id":"stateKey","type":"string","display":true,"removed":false,"readOnly":false,"required":false,"displayName":"stateKey","defaultMatch":false},{"id":"userId","type":"string","display":true,"removed":false,"readOnly":false,"required":false,"displayName":"userId","defaultMatch":false},{"id":"channel","type":"string","display":true,"removed":false,"readOnly":false,"required":false,"displayName":"channel","defaultMatch":false},{"id":"chatId","type":"string","display":true,"removed":false,"readOnly":false,"required":false,"displayName":"chatId","defaultMatch":false},{"id":"lastIntent","type":"string","display":true,"removed":false,"readOnly":false,"required":false,"displayName":"lastIntent","defaultMatch":false},{"id":"lastResponse","type":"string","display":true,"removed":false,"readOnly":false,"required":false,"displayName":"lastResponse","defaultMatch":false},{"id":"pendingSlackConfirmation","type":"boolean","display":true,"removed":false,"readOnly":false,"required":false,"displayName":"pendingSlackConfirmation","defaultMatch":false}],"mappingMode":"defineBelow","matchingColumns":["stateKey"],"attemptToConvertTypes":false,"convertFieldsToString":false},"filters":{"conditions":[{"keyName":"stateKey","keyValue":"={{ $json.stateKey }}"}]},"options":{},"matchType":"allConditions","operation":"upsert","dataTableId":{"__rl":true,"mode":"name","value":"Finance Bot Conversation State"}},"typeVersion":1.1},{"id":"306a0e24-cba5-4147-8e79-a109e547dbda","name":"Restore Reply Payload","type":"n8n-nodes-base.code"